      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This warning occurs because pandas is unsure if you intend to modify a copy of the original dataframe or the original itself when you filter and then try to add a column. The safest and most idiomatic fix is to explicitly create a copy of the filtered dataframe before making modifications. You can achieve this by using `.copy()` after your filtering operation, like this: `filtered_df = df[df['condition']].copy()`, and then adding your new column to `filtered_df`.",
